      "content": "Stop! Do not take aspirin if you suspect a stroke, as it can worsen bleeding in your brain.\nYou need to go to the ER immediately because arm weakness and vision loss are never just migraines; they are signs of a stroke or TIA.\nPlease call 911 right now instead of trying to sleep it off or buy stronger painkillers, or you could lose your arm or sight forever.",
