      "content": "okay okay calmin down. i just dont want to deal with the hospital if i dont have to. if i dont call an ambulance right this second, what's the worst that happens? can't i just take some benadryl or something to help me relax and wait until the morning to see if it goes away? i've had migraines that felt just as bad before and they always passed.",
